  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたたかい　いわのうえで　ねころびしかくい　うろこから　とりこんだ　ねつでほのおエネルギーを　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "따뜻한 바위 위에 드러누워서 네모난 비늘을 통해 흡수한 열로 불꽃 에너지를 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會躺在溫熱的岩石上，用四角形的鱗片所吸收的熱能來製造火之能量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il s’allonge sur des pierres chaudes et produit de l’énergie de type Feu grâce à la chaleur absorbée par ses écailles rectangulaires.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es legt sich auf warme Steine und nimmt so über seine rechteckigen Schuppen Hitze auf, mit der es Feuer-Energie erzeugt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Yace sobre rocas calientes, cuyo calor transforma en energía ígnea tras absorberlo por sus escamas rectangulares.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le sue squame rettangolari gli permettono di assorbire il calore dalle rocce calde su cui si sdraia per trasformarlo in energia Fuoco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lies on warm rocks and uses the heat absorbed by its square-shaped scales to create fire energy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "温かい　岩の上で　寝転び四角い　うろこから　取り込んだ　熱で炎エネルギーを　作る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会躺在温暖的岩石上，利用四边形的鳞片吸收的热量来制造火之能量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Yace sobre rocas calientes, cuyo calor transforma en energía ígnea tras absorberlo por sus escamas rectangulares.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほのおぶくろが　ちいさく　あふれでたエネルギーが　あたまの　くぼみからほうしゅつされ　ゆらゆら　ゆれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "불꽃 주머니가 작기 때문에 흘러넘친 에너지가 머리의 움푹한 곳을 통해 새어 나와 일렁거린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "火囊很小，因此能量會溢出來，在牠頭上的凹槽那裡搖曳晃動。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa poche à flammes est trop petite pour contenir toute l’énergie qu’il produit. Le surplus s’échappe en vacillant par la cavité sur sa tête.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Flammensack ist noch klein, weshalb überquellende Energie über die Vertiefung an seinem Kopf flackernd freigesetzt wird.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Como su saca de fuego es pequeña, la energía ígnea que rebosa se libera por la muesca de su cabeza en forma de una trémula llama.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La sua sacca ignea è piccola e l’energia trabocca, fuoriuscendo sotto forma di fiammelle tremule da una fessura sulla testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its flame sac is small, so energy is always leaking out. This energy is released from the dent atop Fuecoco’s head and flickers to and fro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "炎袋が　小さく　あふれ出たエネルギーが　頭の　くぼみから放出され　ゆらゆら　揺れる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "火囊很小，因此能量会从头部的凹陷处溢出来，并摇曳晃动着。",
      "language": {
